<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoNodeGetStatus</function></refname>
  <refpurpose>Get the status of a node</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Node.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">enum SilikoNodeStatus SilikoNodeGetStatus(
    const SilikoNode *object);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <function>SilikoNodeGetStatus</function> function gets the
status of <varname>object</varname>.</para>
</refsection>

<refsection>
<title>Return Values</title>

<para><function>SilikoNodeGetStatus</function> returns the status of
<varname>object</varname>, a value indicating whether
<varname>object</varname> is a leaf, branch, or nothing.</para>
</refsection>
